oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314729_721436630462584_4493067889458061892_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HZMl6RUCoK0Q7kNvwEZWMgl&_nc_oc=Adopy30no2JneZJ72pMUrYVsEd5cFsi5qBt8AiUD-2MVTts1sed9ZH97PjXd6DABFDo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNX18WAeJhGUQwmN_AIuMi1R4k17UoF6PwjYinVEkANsg&oe=6AC919E7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Racket Rush", "keywords": ["Tennis", "hypercasual", "sports", "Sim"], "long_description": "Tennis VR: Practice Your Swing in Virtual Reality!\n\nStep onto the court and sharpen your tennis skills in this immersive VR training experience. In Tennis VR, you\u2019ll face a steady stream of tennis balls coming your way\u2014your goal is simple: hit as many as you can with your racket and rack up points!\n\nDesigned for players of all skill levels, this game is perfect for warming up your reflexes, improving hand-eye coordination, or just enjoying the thrill of hitting balls in a virtual tennis arena. Every hit earns you points, and every second counts\u2014can you beat your high score before the timer runs out?\n\nWhether you're looking for a quick session or an intense rally challenge, Tennis VR delivers fast-paced fun with intuitive mechanics and satisfying racket physics. It\u2019s tennis practice made accessible, engaging, and sweat-worthy in VR!\n\nKey Features:\n\nIntuitive racket controls with realistic hit feedback\n\nScore-based gameplay with a timed challenge\n\nSimple, clean visuals focused on performance and f", "short_description": "Train your swing in this fun and fast-paced tennis practice game!\nHit incoming balls with your racket to earn points. Test your reflexes, improve your timing, and aim for the highest score before time runs out. \n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://lucido.life/policy/racketrush/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lucido Inc", "support_website_url": nu